flowchart TD
    A[User submits health payload] --> B[Health route and controller]
    B --> C[Health service canonical ingest]
    C --> D{Schema valid?}
    D -- No --> E[Return validation errors]
    D -- Yes --> F[Deduplication check]
    F --> G{Duplicate found?}
    G -- Yes --> H[Skip insert and return duplicate status]
    G -- No --> I[Compute score and ML assessment]
    I --> J[Persist health record]
    J --> K[Generate alert if threshold crossed]
    K --> L[Return success response]

    subgraph Smartwatch Source Path
      S1[Sync adapter returns metric payload] --> S2{Required metrics complete?}
      S2 -- No --> S3[Reject insert under strict policy]
      S2 -- Yes --> C
    end
